    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you may designate a single creature, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> or object within your line of sight as the target of <b>Combined Fire</b>. Any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Batteries\" title=\"Weapon Batteries\">Weapon Batteries</a> attacking the target deal an extra die of damage for every 2 points by which their attack roll exceeds the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> (instead of every 3 points).<br><br>In addition, when using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tactical_Fire\" title=\"Tactical Fire\">Tactical Fire</a> option for a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Capital_Ship\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Capital Ship\">Capital Ship</a>, you may designated a weapon or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Battery\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Battery\">Weapon Battery</a> to make a single attack.",
